== Overview ==
'''Boss Toilet''' is the final boss of [[Easy Mode]], and has 3 other, stronger variants. They are the [[Boss Toilet 2.0]],[[Boss Toilet 3.0]] and the [[Boss Toilet 4.0]]. The Boss Toilet has a high amount of HP, but is very slow to make it up. It does not have any stunning abilities, which makes it easier to defeat, but it appears very early in the game in [[Hard Mode|Hard]], [[Nightmare Mode|Nightmare]], and Abysmal Mode.

