== Strategy ==
* The Boss Toilet has a very high amount of health for when it appears, so with normal defenses it will not be able to be taken out.
* Use units like [[Ninja Cameraman]], [[Dark Speakerman]], or possibly [[Camera Helicopter]] to defeat this enemy.
* You can tank one Boss Toilet, as it does 250 damage to the base, but this means that you cannot take any more damage from bosses unless your base is healed by [[Large Scientist Cameraman]] or [[Healer TV Woman]].
* In Easy Mode, the Boss Toilet is the final boss. It has about 40,000 HP, which you can defeat with the normal Speakerman if you sell and replace your units to attack the Boss Toilet. 

