== Trivia ==

* His old damage was 50 before New Lobby update.
* Most people lose the game in [[Nightmare Mode]] due to the boss toilet and [[Flying Buzzsaw Toilet]].
* It is most likely based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/G-Toilet G-Toilet], like the other Boss Toilets. However, we do not know if it is actually based off of it. This was later confirmed when [[Boss Toilet 2.0]] and [[Boss Toilet 3.0]] were added in the [[Episode 57 Update]].
* It only deals 250 damage, despite being a 'boss' toilet because players with only the Speakerman unit can't beat the Boss Toilet in Easy Mode. Meaning in Toilet City, as long as you have over 250 health, you can still win the match, even if it still reaches the end.
* In [[Hard Mode|har]][[Nightmare Mode|der]] [[Abysmal Mode (Halloween Event)|gam]][[Christmas Mode|emo]][[Endless Mode|des]], the Boss Toilet is very common, being spammed in quick succession for later waves so you might need AoE units.
* A Wave 1 Boss Toilet have 10000HP, adding 1500HP for it per round.

